  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "If the papers of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> students can be checked by any one of the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math> teachers, then the probability that all the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> papers are checked by exactly <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> teachers, is equal to",
